## 26. Draft in Sections

Instead of asking AI to produce an entire polished asset immediately, work in stages:

1. Review the objective.
2. Review the sources.
3. Create the claim register.
4. Propose an outline.
5. Approve the outline.
6. Draft one section at a time.
7. Verify each section.
8. Add human examples.
9. Review voice.
10. Develop the close.
11. Complete final approval.

This reduces the risk of polished errors hiding inside a long draft.

