## 54. Ethical Communication Review

Confirm:

- [ ] The opening does not manipulate.
- [ ] The middle presents evidence fairly.
- [ ] The close does not pressure unnecessarily.
- [ ] Claims remain supportable.
- [ ] Customer vulnerability is respected.
- [ ] Counterarguments are represented fairly.
- [ ] Uncertainty is visible.
- [ ] Human responsibility is not hidden behind AI.
- [ ] The communication provides genuine value.

